    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brave heroes, save the kingdom of Elonia!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFate And Destiny - The Elonia Chronicles\u201d is a heroic fantasy RPG inspired by  &quot;dungeon crawler&quot; board game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an epic adventure during a 15-chapters campaign, more than 10h of play, where you'll meet a host of characters and explore a variety of locations. Play as different warriors with different characteristics, equip yourself with items to improve your stats, battle ferocious enemies and try to survive the many dangers that await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 6 different warriors, each with their own starting stats and unique skills. It's up to you to create the ideal team to survive the dungeons and dangerous enemies that await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the history of the kingdom of Elonia in a multi-hour scripted campaign, containing 15 thrilling chapters. Your adventure will take you through dangerous dungeons, mysterious forests and other equally perilous locations. And meet a whole host of characters, both friendly and hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your team of heroes, explore different dungeons and battle a wide variety of enemies. Between chapters, take advantage of the store to equip your fighters and become even stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've completed the main campaign, you'll be able to access the Skirmish game mode. This mode lets you experience a 3-map mini-adventure, with random components, for great replayability.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brave heroes, save the kingdom of Elonia!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFate And Destiny - The Elonia Chronicles\u201d is a heroic fantasy RPG inspired by  &quot;dungeon crawler&quot; board game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an epic adventure during a 15-chapters campaign, more than 10h of play, where you'll meet a host of characters and explore a variety of locations. Play as different warriors with different characteristics, equip yourself with items to improve your stats, battle ferocious enemies and try to survive the many dangers that await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 6 different warriors, each with their own starting stats and unique skills. It's up to you to create the ideal team to survive the dungeons and dangerous enemies that await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the history of the kingdom of Elonia in a multi-hour scripted campaign, containing 15 thrilling chapters. Your adventure will take you through dangerous dungeons, mysterious forests and other equally perilous locations. And meet a whole host of characters, both friendly and hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your team of heroes, explore different dungeons and battle a wide variety of enemies. Between chapters, take advantage of the store to equip your fighters and become even stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've completed the main campaign, you'll be able to access the Skirmish game mode. This mode lets you experience a 3-map mini-adventure, with random components, for great replayability.</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Fate and Destiny - The Elonia Chronicles&quot; is a heroic fantasy RPG inspired by dungeon crawler board games. Experience an epic adventure through a 15-chapter story campaign, exploring dungeons, fighting, and meeting a wide variety of characters!",
